    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This memo updates the IANA IPv4 and IPv6 Special-Purpose Address
Registries to address issues raised by the definition of a &quot;global&quot;
prefix.  It also corrects several errors in registry entries to
ensure the integrity of the IANA Special-Purpose Address Registries.</t>
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-2">This memo updates RFC 6890.</t>
    </abstract>
